              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Lazy pipeline",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Source",
                    "sub": "yields one item",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Filter",
                    "sub": "keeps or drops",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Transform",
                    "sub": "x*x",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Consumer",
                    "sub": "pulls the next",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. One-shot traps",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Second loop over a spent generator yields {red:nothing}",
                "`len(g)` and `g[0]` raise {red:TypeError}",
                "**Why a generator for a huge file?** Items on demand, O(1) memory",
                "**Why empty the second time?** Exhausted iterator: rebuild it or use a list"
              ],
              "style": "cross"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Need it twice, or need `len()` or indexing? ==Use a list==."
            }
          ]
        }
