              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Streams and slices",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`count(start, step)`: endless counter",
                "`cycle(it)` repeats forever; `repeat(x, n)` gives x, n times",
                "Stop them with ==islice== or `break`",
                "`islice(it, stop)` or `islice(it, start, stop, step)`: lazy slice",
                "{red:No negative indices}"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "from itertools import count, islice",
                "print(list(islice(count(10, 5), 3)))"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "[10, 15, 20]"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Join and group",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`chain(a, b)` joins without copying",
                "`chain.from_iterable(lists)` flattens one level",
                "==groupby== groups only consecutive equal keys",
                "Sort by the same key first"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Combinatorics",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Call",
                "Order",
                "Gives"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`product(a, b)`",
                  "nested loops",
                  "every pair"
                ],
                [
                  "`combinations(x, r)`",
                  "ignored",
                  "AB, AC, BC"
                ],
                [
                  "`permutations(x, r)`",
                  "respected",
                  "AB, AC, BA..."
                ],
                [
                  "`zip_longest(a, b)`",
                  "pads shorter",
                  "fillvalue"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Gotcha",
              "text": "Unsorted input makes ==groupby== repeat keys: one group per run."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why sort before groupby?** Only adjacent equal keys merge.",
                "**combinations vs permutations?** Order ignored vs respected."
              ],
              "style": "star"
            }
          ]
