              ],
              "note": "bind res first, then yield inside try"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Top Gotchas",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Exhausted generator is ==empty== on the second pass",
                "`groupby` needs ==sorted== input, by the same key",
                "Bare `yield` without `try/finally` leaks cleanup"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Cleanup",
              "text": "Put `yield` inside `try` and cleanup in `finally`, so it runs even when the `with` body raises."
